Package: com.albrhi.ytmusic
Name: Albrhi for YouTube Music
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: No ads in YouTube Music, and playback that keeps going in the background. WITHOUT PREMIUM: this tweak does not unlock a paid subscription and does not report you as a subscriber. It blocks advertising and stops the background-playback upsell, which it does on a free account exactly as on a paid one.
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.albrhi.ytmusic.roothide, com.dvntm.ytmultimate
Replaces: com.albrhi.ytmusic.roothide
Author: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Tag: role::hacker
